{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは！\n愛知県出身22歳の岡本姫奈です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "神宮でのライブの後 お休みを頂いたので\n旅行に行ってきました✈️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またインスタに載せるので楽しみにしててください！！☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この間 なおと江ノ島に行ってきたよ〜🏖🐠"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前回一緒に行った時から3年前経ったらしいです\n時の流れ早すぎて怖いね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なおから\n「あの時みたいに制服着ようよ〜」って言われたけどさすがに辞退しました 笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あの22ですよ、私"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私がゴネて\n結局浴衣で行こうって話にまとまりました笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「私たち大人になったね〜」なんて言いながら\n食べ歩きしたり\n写真撮りあいっこしたり！\n海を見ながら電車に乗ったり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しかった〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobuyZCNY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "せっかくなので\n3年前と同じ画角で撮りました📸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なお 立ち位置とかも覚えてて凄かった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobGbSuQN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "近くにいためちゃくちゃ可愛いJKが撮ってくれました😭 ありがたい😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mob8oKrvN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202609/mobvQNPUE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なおは本当に美味しそうに食べてくれるので\nご飯に行くたびに幸せな気持ちになれます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お互い気を使わずに話せて\n何でも相談できて\nたまに生意気してくるところが可愛くて仕方ないです。\nこれからも沢山甘えてきてね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もうすぐ20歳になってくれるので\n一緒に乾杯するのが楽しみで仕方ないです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "出会えて良かったよ☺️\nまた来年も行こうー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただきありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またすぐ書きます☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日の一曲\nわたがし/backnumberさん"}], "source": "official"}